	<div  class="vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone "   data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
		<div class="vc_column-inner" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1789634507597" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<h2 class="style-scope ytd-watch-metadata"><span style="color: #063190; font-size: 22px;">下一個十年，我們還能為新竹創造什麼？</span></h2>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1789634433790" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 21px;">面對 AI 時代，我希望新竹不只守住科技優勢，更要把科技的力量帶進城市治理與生活；從孩子、青年到長輩，讓每一個世代都有更好的機會與照顧。同時，我們也要把新竹最珍貴的客家文化帶向世界。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 21px;">越在地，越國際；越科技，越有競爭力！新竹已經創造過許多第一，下一個黃金十年，我們要一起創造更多第一。AI新竹，更科技、更有愛。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




		</div> 
	</div>
	</div> 
</div></div>
			</div> 
		</div>
	</div> 
</div></div>
		<div id="fws_6ad5d32c2640e"  data-column-margin="default" data-midnight="dark" data-top-percent="1%" data-bottom-percent="4%"  class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex  top_margin_5pct bottom_padding_phone_8pct"  style="padding-top: calc(100vw * 0.01); padding-bottom: calc(100vw * 0.04); "><div class="row-bg-wrap" data-bg-animation="none" data-bg-animation-delay="" data-bg-overlay="false"><div class="inner-wrap row-bg-layer" ><div class="row-bg viewport-desktop using-bg-color"  style="background-color: #f7f7f7; "></div></div></div><div class="row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left">
	<div style="margin-top: 1%; margin-bottom: -2%; " class="vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding top_margin_tablet_5pct top_margin_phone_5pct bottom_margin_tablet_1pct inherit_tablet inherit_phone "  data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
