	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<h3 style="text-align: center; font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif !important;"><span style="font-size: 21px; color: #0c308f;">新竹的女兒</span></h3>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  wpb_animate_when_almost_visible wpb_slideInDown slideInDown vc_custom_1790147474824" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<h3 style="text-align: center; font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif !important;"><span style="font-size: 24px; color: #0c308f;">認識徐欣瑩</span></h3>
	</div>
</div>



<div class="nectar-flickity not-initialized nectar-carousel tb-spacing-0 " data-centered-cells="false" data-pause-on-hover="" data-touch-icon-color="default" data-control-color="extra-color-1" data-overflow="hidden" data-r-bottom-total="" data-drag-scale="true" data-wrap="no-wrap" data-spacing="default" data-controls="default" data-pagination-alignment="default" data-adaptive-height="true" data-border-radius="10px" data-column-border="" data-column-padding="0" data-format="default" data-autoplay="" data-autoplay-dur="5000" data-control-style="material_pagination" data-desktop-columns="1" data-small-desktop-columns="1" data-tablet-columns="1" data-phone-columns="1" data-column-color=""><div class="flickity-viewport"> <div class="flickity-slider"><div class="cell "><div class="inner-wrap-outer"><div class="inner-wrap" ><div id="fws_6ad5d32c27784" data-midnight="" data-column-margin="none" class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-top"  style=""><div class="row-bg-wrap"> <div class="row-bg" ></div> </div><div class="row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left">
	<div  class="vc_col-sm-7 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column padding-3-percent padding-3-percent_tablet padding-1-percent_phone "   data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
		<div class="vc_column-inner" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1790147579627" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify;font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif !important;color: #ea5d7d;font-size: 22px">徐爸爸徐媽媽教會徐欣瑩的事</p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700005597" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">徐欣瑩的父親徐鏡蘭從小非常喜愛讀書，雖然環境艱苦，徐爸爸還是力爭上游，考上師範大學，後來以34歲的年紀當選新豐鄉長，連選連任，得到省政府表揚，成為新竹縣第一位考績「特優」的績優鄉長。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685699995237" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">徐欣瑩的母親簡百合，政治大學教育系畢業，長期為教育工作服務奉獻。擔任新豐國中輔導主任期間，徐媽媽極力推動技藝教育計畫，讓許多在學業上落後的學生提前到技職學校見習，幫助他們獲得一技之長。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685699998629" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px"><span style="vertical-align: inherit"><span style="vertical-align: inherit">為理想努力不懈的志氣和風骨，是父親傳承給徐欣瑩最大的資產；徐媽媽的言教與身教，教導徐欣瑩要有包容與溫暖的心，為他人盡心盡力，才能展現生命的最大價值。</span></span></span></p>
	</div>
</div>




		</div> 
	</div>
	</div> 

	<div  class="vc_col-sm-5 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column padding-3-percent top_margin_phone_-5pct inherit_tablet padding-3-percent_phone "   data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
		<div class="vc_column-inner" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<div class="img-with-aniamtion-wrap center margin_bottom_tablet_5pct margin_bottom_phone_5pct margin_left_tablet_0px margin_left_phone_0px custom-width-85pct custom-width-tablet-100pct custom-width-phone-100pct " data-max-width="custom" data-max-width-mobile="default" data-shadow="none" data-animation="none"  style="margin-left: -10%;">
      <div class="inner">
        <div class="hover-wrap"> 
          <div class="hover-wrap-inner">
            <img decoding="async" class="img-with-animation skip-lazy" data-delay="0" height="600" width="600" data-animation="none" src="https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/全家福600.jpg" alt="徐欣瑩｜新竹縣第一選區立法委參選人｜全家福合影" srcset="https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/全家福600.jpg 600w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/全家福600-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/全家福600-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/全家福600-100x100.jpg 100w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/全家福600-140x140.jpg 140w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/全家福600-500x500.jpg 500w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/全家福600-350x350.jpg 350w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
		</div> 
	</div>
	</div> 
</div></div></div></div></div><div class="cell "><div class="inner-wrap-outer"><div class="inner-wrap" ><div id="fws_6ad5d32c291a3" data-midnight="" data-column-margin="none" class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-top"  style=""><div class="row-bg-wrap"> <div class="row-bg" ></div> </div><div class="row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left">
	<div  class="vc_col-sm-7 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column padding-3-percent inherit_tablet padding-1-percent_phone "   data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
		<div class="vc_column-inner" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1790147655011" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify;font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif !important;color: #ea5d7d;font-size: 22px">「放棄是最輕鬆的！」</p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700012702" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">徐欣瑩從小是運動健將，就讀山崎國小時，她代表學校參加鄉運比賽，得到一百公尺金牌和壘球擲遠金牌，壘球擲遠甚至破了大會紀錄，高中時北上就讀中山女高參加籃球校隊，更拿下台北市立高中聯賽的冠軍。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700016462" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">有一場比賽比分落後，也跑不動了，正想放棄時，體育老師激勵她：「放棄是最輕鬆的。」從此之後她下定決心，只要她想做，一定撐到最後一秒鐘，這也讓她總是帶著衝勁、不放棄的心來面對任何事情。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685699745599" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">體育場上的訓練，讓她日後堅持清廉從政，面對任何棘手的民眾託付、陳情事項、或艱難的公眾議題時，皆能以努力不懈的態度突破困難。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




		</div> 
	</div>
	</div> 

	<div  class="vc_col-sm-5 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column padding-3-percent top_margin_phone_-3pct inherit_tablet padding-3-percent_phone "   data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
