</div></div></div></div></div><div class="cell "><div class="inner-wrap-outer"><div class="inner-wrap" ><div id="fws_6ad5d32c2a92c" data-midnight="" data-column-margin="none" class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-top"  style=""><div class="row-bg-wrap"> <div class="row-bg" ></div> </div><div class="row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left">
	<div  class="vc_col-sm-7 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column padding-3-percent inherit_tablet padding-1-percent_phone "   data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
		<div class="vc_column-inner" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1790147680763" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify;font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif !important;color: #ea5d7d;font-size: 22px">台灣第一位衛星測量女博士</p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700022744" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">就讀碩士班的徐欣瑩，因為研究全球海水面模型的論文，獲得了美國太空總署NASA資深科學家的賞識而提供攻讀博士班的全額獎學金。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700027062" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">許多人知道徐欣瑩為了照顧生病的母親，放棄NASA獎學金赴美深造的機會，但很少人知道，2005年她第一次參選縣議員時，丹麥太空總署也曾來函、要出資邀請她前往進行研究。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700031141" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">當時的她只信守在母親病重時曾發下的宏願：「不為己利、服務人群」，而以一紙「已轉換跑道」感謝函回絕邀請。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700034965" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">同年年底，選民以第二高票賦予候選人徐欣瑩一席新竹縣議員席位，用選票表達心中對於政治要改變、這片土地要改變的期待。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




		</div> 
	</div>
	</div> 

	<div  class="vc_col-sm-5 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column padding-3-percent top_margin_phone_-3pct inherit_tablet padding-3-percent_phone "   data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
		<div class="vc_column-inner" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<div class="img-with-aniamtion-wrap center margin_bottom_tablet_5pct margin_bottom_phone_5pct margin_left_tablet_0px margin_left_phone_0px custom-width-85pct custom-width-tablet-100pct custom-width-phone-100pct " data-max-width="custom" data-max-width-mobile="default" data-shadow="none" data-animation="none"  style="margin-left: -10%;">
      <div class="inner">
        <div class="hover-wrap"> 
          <div class="hover-wrap-inner">
            <img decoding="async" class="img-with-animation skip-lazy" data-delay="0" height="600" width="600" data-animation="none" src="https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/孝順.jpg" alt="徐欣瑩｜新竹縣第一選區立法委參選人｜母親病重曾發下弘願" srcset="https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/孝順.jpg 600w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/孝順-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/孝順-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/孝順-100x100.jpg 100w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/孝順-140x140.jpg 140w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/孝順-500x500.jpg 500w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/孝順-350x350.jpg 350w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
		</div> 
	</div>
	</div> 
</div></div></div></div></div><div class="cell "><div class="inner-wrap-outer"><div class="inner-wrap" ><div id="fws_6ad5d32c2c1f1" data-midnight="" data-column-margin="none" class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-top"  style=""><div class="row-bg-wrap"> <div class="row-bg" ></div> </div><div class="row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left">
	<div  class="vc_col-sm-7 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column padding-3-percent inherit_tablet padding-1-percent_phone "   data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
		<div class="vc_column-inner" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1790147708953" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify;font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif;color: #ea5d7d;font-size: 22px">書生報國 政治良心</p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700040943" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">徐欣瑩從政的初衷是感恩、是還願，是為了換得母親健康所立下服務眾人的誓願；在父親過去多年從政、母親為教育付出的身教言教影響下，徐欣瑩認為讀書人應該兼善天下。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700044533" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">一路走來堅持清白參選、清廉從政，徐欣瑩認為認為政治人物要用政見和問政成績與民眾溝通，而非私人小利；她奉行國父說的：「不要做大官，只要做大事」。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700048405" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">常有人問她：「妳念到博士，可以當教授過舒適的生活，為什麼要從政，吃力又不討好？」其實徐欣瑩發現在還願的過程中，她已經化小愛為大愛，深深地愛著支持她、對她有所期許的廣大鄉親，以及蘊育她的這片土地。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




		</div> 
	</div>
	</div> 

	<div  class="vc_col-sm-5 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column padding-3-percent top_margin_phone_-3pct inherit_tablet padding-3-percent_phone "   data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
		<div class="vc_column-inner" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<div class="img-with-aniamtion-wrap center margin_bottom_tablet_5pct margin_bottom_phone_5pct margin_left_tablet_0px margin_left_phone_0px custom-width-85pct custom-width-tablet-100pct custom-width-phone-100pct " data-max-width="custom" data-max-width-mobile="default" data-shadow="none" data-animation="none"  style="margin-left: -10%;">
