        <div class="hover-wrap"> 
          <div class="hover-wrap-inner">
            <img decoding="async" class="img-with-animation skip-lazy" data-delay="0" height="1250" width="1250" data-animation="none" src="https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/書生報國.jpg" alt="徐欣瑩｜新竹縣第一選區立法委參選人｜書生報國政治良心" srcset="https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/書生報國.jpg 1250w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/書生報國-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/書生報國-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/書生報國-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/書生報國-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/書生報國-100x100.jpg 100w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/書生報國-140x140.jpg 140w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/書生報國-500x500.jpg 500w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/書生報國-350x350.jpg 350w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/書生報國-1000x1000.jpg 1000w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/書生報國-800x800.jpg 800w" sizes="(max-width: 1250px) 100vw, 1250px" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
		</div> 
	</div>
	</div> 
</div></div></div></div></div><div class="cell "><div class="inner-wrap-outer"><div class="inner-wrap" ><div id="fws_6ad5d32c2d7f0" data-midnight="" data-column-margin="none" class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-top"  style=""><div class="row-bg-wrap"> <div class="row-bg" ></div> </div><div class="row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left">
	<div  class="vc_col-sm-7 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column padding-3-percent inherit_tablet padding-1-percent_phone "   data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
		<div class="vc_column-inner" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1790147829345" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify;font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif !important;color: #ea5d7d;font-size: 22px">超高標準的服務團隊</p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700053782" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">徐欣瑩自己受過博士教育的訓練，民眾認為徐委員講話有憑有據，並肯定她的理性問政。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700057350" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">特別的是助理群也多是碩博士，還有留美碩士，他們都可以在社會上賺錢過更舒適的生活，但是受到徐欣瑩的理想所感召，放棄高薪工作，投入為公眾服務的領域。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700061381" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">還有她各行各業的好朋友們，支持徐欣瑩清廉從政、清白參選的理念，每逢選舉願意自動擔任義工力挺到底。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685699928518" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">徐欣瑩對她的服務團隊自我要求極高：對民眾的每一件陳情，都不准許延宕，主動讓民眾瞭解處理進度；問政團隊每周固定開會討論，提出的論點定要能釐清問題、專業解決。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




		</div> 
	</div>
	</div> 

	<div  class="vc_col-sm-5 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column padding-3-percent top_margin_phone_-3pct inherit_tablet padding-3-percent_phone "   data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
		<div class="vc_column-inner" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<div class="img-with-aniamtion-wrap center margin_bottom_tablet_5pct margin_bottom_phone_5pct margin_left_tablet_0px margin_left_phone_0px custom-width-85pct custom-width-tablet-100pct custom-width-phone-100pct " data-max-width="custom" data-max-width-mobile="default" data-shadow="none" data-animation="none"  style="margin-left: -10%;">
      <div class="inner">
        <div class="hover-wrap"> 
          <div class="hover-wrap-inner">
            <img decoding="async" class="img-with-animation skip-lazy" data-delay="0" height="600" width="600" data-animation="none" src="https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/團隊600.jpg" alt="徐欣瑩｜新竹縣第一選區立法委參選人｜有超高標準的服務團隊" srcset="https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/團隊600.jpg 600w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/團隊600-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/團隊600-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/團隊600-100x100.jpg 100w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/團隊600-140x140.jpg 140w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/團隊600-500x500.jpg 500w, https://www.shesinging.tw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/團隊600-350x350.jpg 350w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
		</div> 
	</div>
	</div> 
</div></div></div></div></div><div class="cell "><div class="inner-wrap-outer"><div class="inner-wrap" ><div id="fws_6ad5d32c2ee8c" data-midnight="" data-column-margin="none" class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-top"  style=""><div class="row-bg-wrap"> <div class="row-bg" ></div> </div><div class="row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left">
	<div  class="vc_col-sm-7 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column padding-3-percent inherit_tablet padding-1-percent_phone "   data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
		<div class="vc_column-inner" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1790147862227" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify;font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif !important;color: #ea5d7d;font-size: 22px">徐欣瑩吃軟不吃硬？！</p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700068069" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">沒有雄厚背景、堅持清白參選、清廉從政的徐欣瑩不間斷地勤走基層，不斷地溝通理念；她未曾間斷過自己民意代表的職責，同步進行一樁樁民眾陳情服務、會勘安排、以及縣政大小事的溝通協調，每天都是忙到深夜才能用晚餐。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1685700072406" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">助理們心疼徐欣瑩，每每幫徐欣瑩買餐點時都特別注意食物要夠軟，因為她已經累到幾乎沒有力氣可以嚼碎食物。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1681214300459" >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 21px">年輕的徐欣瑩身上流著客家血脈、刻苦耐勞的精神。她不是工作狂，也不是為了追求完美，而是有一顆強烈使命感的心，因為對家鄉、對這片土地濃濃的情感、深深的愛與感恩，驅使著她拼命去實踐理想。</span></p>
	</div>
</div>




		</div> 
	</div>
	</div> 

	<div  class="vc_col-sm-5 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column padding-3-percent top_margin_phone_-3pct inherit_tablet padding-3-percent_phone "   data-padding-pos="all" data-has-bg-color="false" data-bg-color="" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
		<div class="vc_column-inner" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<div class="img-with-aniamtion-wrap  margin_bottom_tablet_5pct margin_bottom_phone_5pct margin_left_tablet_0px margin_left_phone_0px custom-width-85pct custom-width-tablet-100pct custom-width-phone-100pct " data-max-width="custom" data-max-width-mobile="default" data-shadow="none" data-animation="none"  style="margin-left: -10%;">
      <div class="inner">
